      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Distortions bend the grid instead of moving it whole. Whirl & Pinch twists a disc in the middle, swung back and forth by the Oscillator, and pulls it in with a negative Pinch; the Fisheye Lens then bulges the whole frame like a doorway peephole. Set the Fisheye's Distortion below zero for a pincushion."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
